        <p>Since 2015, PowerNest has been at the forefront of solar energy solutions, helping thousands of homes and businesses transition to clean, renewable energy. Our commitment to sustainability drives everything we do.</p>
        <div class="values">
            <div class="value-card">
                <i>🌿</i>
